#==============================================================================================
#
#   viewport_paintable_1 - Painting::ViewportPaintable: the root of the paint tree
#
#   DESCRIPTION:
#       Port of LibWeb/Painting/ViewportPaintable.cpp (lines 1-174) and ViewportPaintable.h:
#       creation and relayout reset, the stacking context tree (built on demand over the
#       paintable boxes in tree order), painting every phase into a display list, and the
#       assignment of scroll frames (with the sticky constraints of sticky boxes).
